            "steam_appid": 733810,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Digital Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/733810/extras/48127379d32ebae8d7bbf78d1517f146.avif?t=1528362122\" width=616 height=94 /></span></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><strong>The best Clutter yet by far. </strong>With Leigh's Story, the Clutter series has risen to a whole new level. For the first time, there is a compelling story with gameplay to match. Additionally, many new Clutter styles of play have been added, including, &quot;Head To Head&quot;, &quot;Clutter Chaos&quot; and &quot;Twos &amp; Threes&quot;. There is truly something here for everyone. All your old favorites are back as well and there are more Clutter 100 levels in Leigh's Story, than ever before.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 500 New Objects <br></li><li>Over 800 Levels <br></li><li>Over 20 hours of Gameplay <br></li><li>75+ Picture Puzzles, 75+ Box Quotes <br></li><li>Puzzles Randomly generated levels provide hours and hours of replayability </li></ul>",
